tweets.text:
Border security isn’t a solitary endeavor—it’s a unified front.
 
This afternoon, I met with the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to refine strategies for information sharing, coordinated enforcement, and decisive action to dismantle criminal operations affecting our shared border. These vital partnerships enhance our capabilities, strengthen our response, and help ensure that transnational threats are stopped before they can endanger our communities.

@rcmpgrcpolice

